WEBVTT

00:11:59.968 --> 00:12:01.850
haupo tayari kugawana.

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:04.066
Kama una shukrani,unafurahia

00:12:04.066 --> 00:12:05.949
tofauti kati ya watu,

00:12:05.949 --> 00:12:08.396
na heshima yako kwa kila mtu,

00:12:08.396 --> 00:12:10.677
na hiyo inabadili piramidi la nguvu

00:12:10.677 --> 00:12:11.956
ambalo tunaishi sasa.

00:12:11.956 --> 00:12:14.935
Na haileti usawa,

00:12:14.935 --> 00:12:17.157
lakini inaleta heshima sawa,

00:12:17.157 --> 00:12:19.161
na hicho ni kitu muhimu.

00:12:19.161 --> 00:12:22.861
Dunia ya baadaye itakuwa mtandao,

00:12:22.861 --> 00:12:26.511
sio piramidi,ambalo limegeuzwa juu chini

00:12:26.511 --> 00:12:28.760
Mabadiliko ninayoongelea

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.947
sio mabadiliko ya vurugu,